[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_fi35r"]
script = ExtResource("1_elffh")
action_name = "Review"
action_prompt = "Based on whatever context the user provides and the code selected:

´´´gdscript
{CODE}
´´´

Analyze for errors, bugs, issues, potential inefficiencies, lack of best practices, and more. If you don't find any issues, then don't do anything, just say everything's good."
